Subject: [PATCH 08/10] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...s Swift is is Comparable & SendableMetatype & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...+Order.swift => Swift.Comparable where Self is Copyable.swift} | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Order/{Order.Comparator+Comparable.swift => Order.Comparator where T is Swift is is Comparable & SendableMetatype & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Order/{Swift.Comparable+Order.swift => Swift.Comparable where Self is Copyable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Order/Order.Comparator+Comparable.swift b/Sources/Order/Order.Comparator where T is Swift is is Comparable & SendableMetatype & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Order/Order.Comparator+Comparable.swift
rename to Sources/Order/Order.Comparator where T is Swift is is Comparable & SendableMetatype & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Order/Swift.Comparable+Order.swift b/Sources/Order/Swift.Comparable where Self is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Order/Swift.Comparable+Order.swift
rename to Sources/Order/Swift.Comparable where Self is Copyable.swift
